<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Soundview starts CompuCom.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Soundview starts CompuCom.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Soundview computer distribution and services analyst Tom Cal said he began coverage of CompuCom Systems Inc with a short-term buy rating and a long-term hold.</p>
<p>-- In a statement, he said he set earnings estimates of $0.57 per share for the 1996 fiscal year, $0.73 per share for fiscal 1997, and $0.88 per share for fiscal 1998.</p>
<p>-- He was not immediately available to comment further.</p>
<p>-- The stock stood at 11-5/8 in mid-morning trading, unchanged on the day.</p>
<p>-- E. Auchard, Wall Street bureau, 212-859-1736</p>
</text>
